{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Evil Inside is a single player highly atmospheric Horror Adventure game inspired by a retro classic Haunted House, in a modern re-take.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A top down perspective gives you a dark and atmospheric environment to navigate, and you must avoid a evil creatures that inhabit that area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant Spiders, Bats, Ghosts, Vampires, Werewolves, Demons, Chainsaw wielding maniacs are all out to stop you in your task to retrieve and rebuild 3 pieces of broken Relic-Stones, and return them to a portal to banish the creatures.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Spooky atmoshpere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top Down Survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location has a special &quot;Boss&quot; Monster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock extra levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ingame Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3676930?t=1771608230","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676930/66d44bba6938dc1fd870887235d2d5b517c61e6b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771608230","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676930/669cb6fa31e5b861ddcc824451daa1b57ab17178/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771608230","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676930/669cb6fa31e5b861ddcc824451daa1b57ab17178/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771608230","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game is a Horror themed game and contains scares, some blood, and gore which may be unsuitable to children."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Evil Inside is a single pla